NAME
     uniq - report or drop repeated lines

SYNOPSIS
     uniq [-c] [-d] [-u] [-i] [INPUT [OUTPUT]]

DESCRIPTION
     uniq compares each line with the one before it, so its input is
     usually sorted.

OPTIONS
     -c   put the count in front of each line
     -d   only the lines that repeat
     -u   only the lines that do not
     -i   ignore case

SEE ALSO
     sort(1), comm(1)
